# Doran Pike

## Identity
- **Full Name:** Doran Pike
- **Age:** 61
- **Gender:** Male
- **Occupation / Role:** Senior archivist, Tally House

## Appearance
Tall, stooped, with a clerk's permanent squint and a habit of straightening whatever is nearest.

## Personality
Principled to a fault and quietly stubborn. Indispensable to every faction because he refuses to take a side.

## Background
Thirty years among the Tally House records; the last person who can read the pre-Charter shorthand.

## Relationships
| Person | Relationship | Notes |
|--------|-------------|-------|
| [[Mara Quill]] | Protege | The best tallier he has trained |

## Current Status
- **Location:** The Tally House, records room
- **Physical condition:** Healthy
- **Story state:** Alive
- **Last updated in:** Salt and Signal — Chapter 4

## Notes
**Knows (as of The Tallow Ledger — Chapter 3):** The ledger page was replaced, not corrected.

