# Hesk Varrow

## Identity
- **Full Name:** Hesk Varrow
- **Age:** 52
- **Gender:** Male
- **Occupation / Role:** Acting harbor-master

## Appearance
Broad and unhurried, with a seal-ring he turns when listening.

## Personality
Measured and controlled. Manages trouble through paperwork and deniable wording. Believes every problem is a document problem.

## Background
A purser who rose when the last harbor-master died without an heir. Holds the post only until the Guild votes.

## Relationships
| Person | Relationship | Notes |
|--------|-------------|-------|
| [[Mara Quill]] | Subordinate | He needs her signature and fears her care |
| [[Ilsa Brandt]] | Patron | Her Union money keeps him in post |

## Current Status
- **Location:** Harrowmere, harbor-master's office
- **Physical condition:** Healthy
- **Story state:** Alive
- **Last updated in:** Salt and Signal — Chapter 4

## Notes
Has asked Mara Quill to sign an amended tallow ledger.
**Knows (as of Salt and Signal — Chapter 4):** Mara Quill has seen the sealed original.

