# The Charter of Three Seals

## Overview
- **Type:** Foundation document
- **Origin culture:** Harrowmere
- **Age:** Two centuries

## Summary
Three founding seals, held by guild, union and wardens, must all agree before the harbor's law can change.

## Full Text
> Three founding seals, held by guild, union and wardens, must all agree before the harbor's law can change.

