# The Tithe Ledger Clause

## Overview
- **Type:** Legal clause
- **Origin culture:** Harbor Guild
- **Age:** Centuries old

## Summary
Any entry in the tithe ledger, once sealed, may only be corrected by a visible strike-through, never by replacement.

## Full Text
> Any entry in the tithe ledger, once sealed, may only be corrected by a visible strike-through, never by replacement.

